# Independent positive scenario: Celebrant untaps an attacking peer with a stun replacement; one counter replaces one untap, without removing it from combat (CR 122.1d, 701.26b, 506.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Combat Celebrant
Sol Ring
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Cryogenic Stasis
Island x30
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x35
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
